{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QbetaZRecursionToCkRecursionBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QbetaZRecursionToCkRecursionBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.z_recursion_forward_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.z_recursion_forward_form","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L52-L71","doc":"**Theorem (forward form of the z-recursion).** For any\n`ZRecursionCoeffs` instance and any `n ≥ 1`,\n`a_{n+1}` is a linear combination of `a_n` and `a_{n-1}` with\ncoefficients given by `z_recursion_kernel n`.\n\nThis makes explicit the depth-2 linear structure of the z-Taylor\nrecursion, in the form analogous to (but with variable kernel\ninstead of constant kernel of) `QOU.QBeta.CKRecursion.applyRecursion`.\n\n**Proof.** Algebraic rearrangement of `w.recursion n hn`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge","label":"prop:qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.z_recursion_kernel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.z_recursion_kernel","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L45-L50","doc":"The n-dependent kernel of the z-Taylor 3-term recursion in\nforward form. Note: NOT constant in n, hence not directly an instance\nof `CKRecursion ℝ`'s `Fin depth → R` constant-kernel structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.recursion","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.initial_1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.initial_1","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.initial_0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.initial_0","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.a","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ZRecursionCoeffs","kind":"class","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean#L37-L43","doc":"Inlined from `prop:qbeta-per-block-chi-closed-forms` (PR #1764). ","signatureChunk":0}]}